<title>USA: U.S. stocks add to late-session gains.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks add to late-session gains.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks extended their late-session gains on Friday, as Wall Street cheered news of a balanced budget deal in Washington.</p>
<p>The Dow was up 98 points, or 1.3 percent, at 7073 after hitting a session high up 100 points. The Nasdaq composite was up 33 points, or 2.6 percent, at 1303.</p>
